<title>SPAIN: Cantabrico confirms '96 profit rose 27.4pct.</title>
<headline>Cantabrico confirms '96 profit rose 27.4pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Hidrocantabrico's 1996 net profit rose 27.4 percent to 16.49 billion pesetas, the firm said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>This confirms information obtained by Reuters earlier today.</p>
<p>Hidrocantabrico added that financial expenses fell 16 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>Total debt was 96.48 billion pesetas by year-end, up 10.49 billion from the year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
